WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,940 --> 00:00:02,940
The Qin family doesn’t know about this yet, right?

2
00:00:02,940 --> 00:00:07,660
Keeping it secret all the time is not an option.

3
00:00:07,660 --> 00:00:10,920
When are you going to talk to your Uncle Qin about this?

4
00:00:10,920 --> 00:00:12,920
I really haven't thought about it

5
00:00:12,920 --> 00:00:15,560
It's really hard to handle

6
00:00:15,560 --> 00:00:17,490
Otherwise

7
00:00:19,260 --> 00:00:21,260
Your dad and I will beat you up a little bit first.

8
00:00:21,260 --> 00:00:23,260
You go to Qin's house again to admit your mistake

9
00:00:23,260 --> 00:00:25,540
Maybe your Uncle Qin thinks you are miserable enough

10
00:00:25,540 --> 00:00:26,540
I relented

11
00:00:26,540 --> 00:00:31,460
You are really my mother and father

12
00:00:31,460 --> 00:00:34,460
Yuyu’s Dudu said she was hungry

13
00:00:34,460 --> 00:00:37,460
Grandma’s good granddaughter is hungry

14
00:00:37,460 --> 00:00:38,460
What do you want to eat for lunch?

15
00:00:38,460 --> 00:00:40,710
Braised chicken legs

16
00:00:40,710 --> 00:00:41,710
And braised
